OL,3,AAI firm Anthropic makes stock market
OL,4,Adebut with $1.5tn valuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI firm Anthropic is listed publicly
OL,7,Ffor the first time, with the stock
OL,8,Fmarket in New York now open
OL,10,FThe company behind AI product Claude
OL,11,Fwas valued at $1.5tn (#1.14tn) after
OL,12,Fraising a record $81bn ahead of its
OL,13,Fstock market debut
OL,15,FThe flotation is being seen as a
OL,16,Fcrucial test for the AI sector, with
OL,17,FAnthropic the first purely AI-focused
OL,18,Ffirm to sell shares publicly
